        "original_id": "bb168041-be6b-5f32-8568-fa64234e37aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Return to Oz, Midnight Madness\n- People: Walter Murch, Gill Dennis, Paul Maslansky, David Naughton, Stephen Furst, Maggie Roswell, David Shire\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Works: The Wizard of Oz, Baby, Closer Than Ever, Starting Here, Starting Now\n\nFacts:\n- In 1980, Walt Disney Productions produced the American comedy film Midnight Madness.\n- In 1980, David Naughton, Stephen Furst, and Maggie Roswell starred in Midnight Madness.\n- In 1985, Walter Murch directed and co-wrote the fantasy adventure film Return to Oz.\n- In 1985, Gill Dennis co-wrote Return to Oz, and Paul Maslansky produced it.\n- In 1985, David Shire composed the score for Return to Oz.\n- Return to Oz is described as a sequel-in-part to The Wizard of Oz.\n- David Shire also wrote stage musical scores for Baby, Closer Than Ever, and Starting Here, Starting Now.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
